Z||000000||fldevel||03-05-2001||05:03 PM||||  i can drive the car all day as long as im not going over 70 but as soon as i hit the highway and doing over 70 for more than a few minutes the check engine light comes on ?? whats the deal ??||||reg||1
Z||000001||mshill||03-05-2001||05:45 PM||||I would put money on a code 32 (EGR) if you pull the codes.  You likely have a broken EGR tube or bad EGR solenoid.<P>I had this same symptom and it was a cracked tube right under the plenum.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Indyellowgt||03-05-2001||07:56 PM||||Maybe a bad 0xygen sensor...?(forgot code..)||||reg||1
Z||000003||Old Lar||03-05-2001||09:12 PM||||I'll go with code 32 and some problem with EGR system.  Mine come on intermittantly at highway speed.  I've been replacing vacuum lines.  Since I can't keep the Check engine light on continusly, I change something, the light is off for a day or two or an hour or 20 minutes.  Hard to trouble shoot. EGR tube was replace in 96.  I have another and a solinoid.  The car runs fine with the light on for me.||||reg||3
Z||000004||EdsB52||03-05-2001||10:39 PM||||Don't drive over 70 mph, or remove the bulb.||||reg||1
